# Weatherglass Deep (CIPlay weatherglass_deep): the shoal's drowned twin, 20 m down; the station, the drowned log, the
# north keeper's drowned house and note (10-25 deep pass), the pufferfish, the drowned chest and the twin's answer.
island Weatherglass Deep
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Drowned Twin
zone drowned_station
expect step 1
read Drowned log
expect step 2
zone jonashouse
expect step 3
read North keeper Jonas
expect step 4
zone drowned_reef
kill Puffer fish
expect step 5
open Drowned chest
wait 3
expect step 6
read Twin's answer
expect done